Rāvaṇa tours Laṅkā guards and sees war the only escape --- Rāvaṇa names himself Kumbhakarṇa Prahasta Indrajit or Nikumbha for burden --- Prahasta counsels returning Sītā yet pledges life for Rāvaṇa --- Prahasta worships fire honors brāhmaṇas and mounts shining chariot --- Prahasta exits east gate with roaring host amid dire omens --- Monkeys seize trees and rocks and shout for battle